Historical standard DLI business event and unattributed ring witnesses.
Exact base/source hashes in retirement-audit.json. No production include.
The old decoded events had no worker consumer and carried no canonical lifetime.
Current standard ingress accepts command responses/credits and HardwareError only;
Native WS73 discovery,physical links,ACB/security Session paths remain separate existing consumers.
These witnesses preserve parsing/ring behavior,not standards conformance or new feature qualification.

run_standard_events.py requires a full matching Kernel source tree,as do the
existing production-source fixture runners;installing these data files alone
is not a standalone kernel-interface test suite.
